[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## 📌 Overview[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe **Secure Multi-Tenant RAG Platform** is designed to simplify enterprise document search using Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) and Agentic AI.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mIt enables multiple organizations to interact with their own knowledge bases through intelligent search while maintaining strict data isolation and access control.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## 🚀 Key Features[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- 🔐 **Multi-Tenant Security** – Isolated organizational data and secure access.[m
[32m+[m[32m- 👥 **Role-Based Access Control** – Authorized document access.[m
[32m+[m[32m- 🔎 **Hybrid Search** – BM25 and semantic search.[m
[32m+[m[32m- 🎯 **Reciprocal Rank Fusion** – Combines retrieval results.[m
[32m+[m[32m- 🧠 **CrossEncoder Reranking** – Improves retrieval relevance.[m
[32m+[m[32m- 🤖 **Agentic RAG** – Multi-agent reasoning for answer generation.[m
[32m+[m[32m- 🔄 **Multi-LLM Support** – Flexible AI provider integration.[m
[32m+[m[32m- 💬 **Knowledge Chat** – Interactive document-based question answering.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## ⚙️ Technology Stack[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Backend:** Python, FastAPI[m[41m  [m
[32m+[m[32m**Frontend:** React.js[m[41m  [m
[32m+[m[32m**AI Framework:** LangChain[m[41m  [m
[32m+[m[32m**Database:** PostgreSQL, ChromaDB / FAISS[m[41m  [m
[32m+[m[32m**LLM Providers:** Gemini, Groq, OpenAI, Anthropic[m[41m  [m
[32m+[m[32m**Security:** JWT, RBAC[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## 🔄 Workflow[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m`Document Upload → Text Extraction → Chunking → Embeddings → Hybrid Retrieval → Reranking → Agentic Reasoning → Answer Generation`[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## 🎯 Objective[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mTo build a secure and scalable enterprise knowledge retrieval system that delivers relevant, context-aware answers while protecting organizational information.[m
